1.1 — What each top-level bucket contains
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  [root files]     Project metadata: README, LICENSE, CHANGELOG, CODEOWNERS,
                   CONTRIBUTING, SECURITY, Makefile, docker-compose*.yml,
                   .gitignore, .editorconfig, .envrc, .pre-commit, etc.

  .github/         CI/CD pipelines, issue templates, PR template,
                   Dependabot, labeler.
                   40 workflows (ci-*, cd-*, nightly-*, ops-*, release-*).

  docs/            ALL documentation in 9 waves under phase-1-foundation/.
                   wave-0  governance (GOV-001..020, DEV-001, DEV-002)
                   wave-1  requirements (REQ-001..017)
                   wave-2  architecture (ARCH-001..017 + 13 diagrams)
                   wave-3  detailed design
                             data/    (DATA-001..013)
                             api/     (API-001..016)
                             ui/      (UI-001..013)
                             security/(SEC-001..010, 012..014)
                   wave-4  testing (TEST-001..014, SEC-011, TEST-016..018)
                   wave-5  devops + operations (INF-001..036, OPS-001..012)
                   wave-6  developer standards (DEV-003..012, 014..018)
                   wave-7  project tracking (DEV-013, PM-001..016)
                   wave-8  user support (USR-001..009)
                   wave-9  supporting artifacts (NFR-HOLD-001, NOTES-AI-001..003)

  clients/         Front-end applications.
                   web/    customer-portal (Next.js, customer-facing)
                           employee-portal (Next.js, staff-facing)
                           shared          (shared TS package)
                   mobile/ android-sms-gateway (Kotlin Android, SMS bridge)
                           message-app        (Flutter, admin mobile UI)

  contracts/       API + event contracts.
                   openapi/  S1-IAM, S2-master-data, S3-reservation,
                             S4-search-bff, S5-payment-gateway
                   asyncapi/ S3-reservation-publishes, S6-notification-consumes
                   examples/ booking-created/confirmed/waitlisted, payment-callback
                   spectral/ lint rules
                   pact/     consumer-driven contract pacts

  database/        Per-service schema migrations, seeds, initdb, rollback,
                   expected-schema snapshots, naming rules.
                   iam/          V1..V9 + U1..U9  (18 files)
                   master-data/  V1..V11 + U1..U11 (22 files)
                   reservation/  V1..V15 + U1..U15 (30 files)
                   notification/ V1..V6 + U1..U6   (12 files)

  services/        Back-end microservices.
                   java/   s2-master-data  (Spring Boot, JPA, Flyway)
                           s3-reservation  (Spring Boot, Saga, Outbox)
                   node/   s1-iam              (NestJS, Prisma)
                           s4-search-bff       (NestJS, Redis read-model)
                           s5-payment-gateway  (NestJS, provider-swap)
                           s6-notification     (NestJS, Redis streams)
                   python/ s6-py-daemon (FastAPI, psutil monitoring, anomaly)

  infra/           Infrastructure-as-code.
                   docker/       per-service Dockerfiles + monitoring images
                   compose/      base + modules/* + environments/{dev,test,prod}
                   nginx/        conf.d/{dev,test,prod} + snippets + certs
                   prometheus/   rules + alerts/{dev,test,prod}
                   grafana/      provisioning + dashboards/{dev,test,prod}
                   loki/         config per env
                   promtail/     config per env
                   tempo/        config per env
                   otel/         collector config
                   alertmanager/ receivers + templates
                   postgres/     postgresql-{dev,test,prod}.conf
                   redis/        redis-{dev,test,prod}.conf
                   k6/           load test image
                   pact-broker/  contract broker
                   stubs/        gmail-smtp-stub, android-sms-stub
                   config/       schema, templates, providers, cloud,
                                 maintenance, launcher, env-matrix
                   maintenance-page/  static HTML when maintenance mode
                   tailscale/    ACL
                   secrets/      dev/test/prod (gitignored)
                   cron/         system cron schedules
                   systemd/      retention, backup, maintenance-scheduler
                   backup/       backup data dir
                   exporters/    postgres_exporter, redis_exporter, node_exporter

  sris-launcher/   Desktop launcher (Java UI + Python engine).
                   java-ui/       Swing UI, ~46 Java files in
                                  com/sarathi/sris/launcher/{bridge,pages,components,styles}
                   python-engine/ sris_launcher_engine package
                                  (elevation, integrity, device, preflight,
                                   autofix, auth, crypto, biometric,
                                   recovery, audit, launcher, install,
                                   registration, update, diagnostics)
                   bridge/        JSON-RPC protocol + JSON schemas
                                  (16 request/response + deadline.event)
                   packaging/     build_bundle, sign_bundle, release, ...
                   installer/     windows/macos/linux installers + bundle
                   build-keys/    developer + update-signing public keys
                   tools/         developer-recovery-cli, verify-manifest
                   config/        launcher-config.toml, update_server.toml
                   service/       systemd/launchd/Windows service defs
                   docs/          12 launcher-specific docs
                   assets/        icons, splash, source SVGs

  scripts/         Automation scripts.
                   bash/        setup, dev, test, ci, deployment,
                                maintenance, ops, analysis
                   powershell/  same structure mirrored for Windows
                   git-hooks/   pre-commit-exec-bit

  tests/           Cross-cutting integration tests (outside service dirs).
                   integration/  15 tests (end-to-end booking, fault-iso,
