1.3 — "Where do I look first?" cheat sheet
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  What the project does ......... docs/phase-1-foundation/wave-0-project-foundation/
  What services exist ........... services/  +  contracts/openapi/
  How to build / run ............ .github/workflows/  +  infra/compose/
  Where a feature is implemented  services/<lang>/<sN>/src/main/
  Front-end screens ............. clients/web/customer-portal/app/
                                  clients/web/employee-portal/app/
  Launcher behaviour ............ sris-launcher/python-engine/src/sris_launcher_engine/
  How deployment works .......... infra/compose/environments/  +  scripts/bash/deployment/
  How testing is wired .......... tests/  +  services/*/src/test/

